WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.709
Speaker 1: We learned late last night about
a major change to the scope of the current

00:00:05.709 --> 00:00:06.709
New Yorker.

00:00:06.709 --> 00:00:12.300
Attorney general's investigation into the
Trump Organization, it is now a criminal investigation,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.429
full stop.

00:00:13.429 --> 00:00:20.190
What started as a civil investigation into
the Trump organization is now a criminal investigation.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:27.140
This is a huge deal and it at least changes
the possible path of the probe.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:34.230
Now, remember that New York State Attorney
General Letitia James was already in the middle

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.960
of a civil investigation of Donald Trump's
company.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:43.730
Now they are investigating the Trump organization,
quote, in a criminal capacity.

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.630
This is also hard to even keep this all straight.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:51.570
This is not the same investigation that Cy
Vance Jr. is doing.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:57.040
James's spokesman says this investigation
is being conducted in conjunction with the

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:01.610
criminal probe of Trump and the Trump organization
by the Manhattan district attorney, Cyrus

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.610
Vance.

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.229
This is the attorney general of New York.

00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:06.619
Now, these are two criminal investigations.

00:01:06.619 --> 00:01:11.829
Now, part of this is all thanks to Michael
Cohen, Donald Trump's former attorney, who

00:01:11.829 --> 00:01:18.130
has said many times now that the Trump organization
misstated real estate valuations to reduce

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:22.240
their tax liabilities and to get better loan
and insurance terms.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:27.350
The full statement from Letitia James's office
is short and it is, quote, We have informed

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:32.009
the Trump Organization that our investigation
into the organization is no longer purely

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:34.009
civil in nature.

00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:39.090
We are now actively investigating the Trump
Organization in a criminal capacity, along

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:41.360
with the Manhattan district attorney.

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:48.219
We have no additional comment at this time,
recalled that Letitia James is the prosecutor

00:01:48.219 --> 00:01:51.029
who went after the Trump Foundation.

00:01:51.029 --> 00:01:56.770
Trump's now dissolved charity was ordered
to pay two million dollars to settle a lawsuit

00:01:56.770 --> 00:02:02.920
by the AG's office, saying he misused the
Trump Foundation and its funds to benefit

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:06.880
his presidential campaign, as well as other
unlawful activity for more than a decade.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:10.539
And the Trump Foundation agreed to pay the
fine, and they also agreed in December of

00:02:10.539 --> 00:02:16.130
twenty eighteen to completely dissolve and
donate all remaining funds to charity.

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:22.439
That's the same Letitia James that got that
done, who is now investigating the Trump organization

00:02:22.439 --> 00:02:23.989
criminally.

00:02:23.989 --> 00:02:27.579
Trump is calling both investigations witch
hunts, which to me suggests, wow, there's

00:02:27.579 --> 00:02:31.750
probably something here and we will see where
both investigations go.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:37.680
Now, I maintain and I know some people get
mad when I say this, I maintain Trump will

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:40.049
see no prison time period.

00:02:40.049 --> 00:02:42.959
There will be no handcuffed perp walk.

00:02:42.959 --> 00:02:48.410
But the more that this builds and now it has
shifted from merely civil to criminal, the

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:51.080
possibility that someone goes to prison does
go up.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:55.400
But almost certainly this is going to be a
massive financial burden on Trump in terms

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.400
of legal bills.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:01.829
And as I've said before, these investigations,
while they're not going to put Trump in prison,

00:03:01.829 --> 00:03:06.560
they're not they could keep Trump from running
in twenty, twenty four, which would be amazing.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:12.819
It's optimistic thinking, but it very well
could quickly become a massive burden for

00:03:12.819 --> 00:03:13.819
Trump.

00:03:13.819 --> 00:03:16.859
And if it keeps him out of out of candidacy
in three and a half years, that would be a

00:03:16.859 --> 00:03:17.859
great thing.

00:03:17.859 --> 00:03:19.829
Now, there's one other aspect to this.

00:03:19.829 --> 00:03:26.689
There are people reacting to news from this
probe and from the Cy Vance probe by saying

00:03:26.689 --> 00:03:29.270
if it's taking this long, nothing is happening.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.069
It's just going to peter out.

00:03:31.069 --> 00:03:35.931
I spoke to a couple of prosecutors I know
who said, you know, from the outside, you

00:03:35.931 --> 00:03:37.430
can't really know.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:42.580
But often the longer the investigation takes,
the stronger the case is because they're uncovering

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:46.440
more and more wrongdoing and they want to
be really sure that the cases are ironclad

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.510
before they move forward.

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.250
Either way, it's speculative.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.280
But the point is, it's not obvious.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:57.040
It's not certain that the fact that this is
dragging with no charges yet is bad.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:02.060
It's also important to remember, at least
with the Cy Vance probe, that Trump was able

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:09.579
to obstruct that moving forward by not providing
his tax returns for his entire presidency.

00:04:09.579 --> 00:04:14.359
Only in the last couple of months did they
finally get a court decision that said, yes,

00:04:14.359 --> 00:04:16.570
Trump must give Cy Vance his taxes.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:19.640
So that part of the investigation has only
really now started.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:22.080
It's been delayed and that could be part of
it as well.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:26.310
One other really small thing, a couple of
people wrote to me and they said this is the

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:27.880
real reason Trump left New York.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:29.230
It wasn't to avoid taxes.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:33.630
It wasn't because New York wasn't good to
him because they didn't vote for him in the

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.760
presidential election.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.820
The real reason Trump left New York was to
get away from this investigation.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:38.970
I just don't think so.

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:39.970
No.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.690
One, Trump is a narcissist and narcissists
have this idea that no one can touch them.

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.830
So I don't think Trump is leaving.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.830
That doesn't make sense.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:51.790
Number two, leaving New York doesn't actually
stop the investigations.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.600
So it would be stupid in that sense.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:57.730
And number three, Trump is really cheap and
really greedy.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:03.730
So leaving changing residency from New York
to Florida makes a lot of sense because avoiding

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:06.140
taxes is completely on brand with.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:11.630
Donald Trump's priority, so that's I believe
that's really the reason Trump left the investigation,

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:15.070
will follow him to Florida if that's what
needs to happen.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:19.310
And it will.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:24.690
I don't think Trump really thinks in the terms
you and I might think of something like this.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:25.690
So I think it's just money.

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:30.020
And that's why Trump left New York, at least
as far as residency is concerned.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:36.960
We'll have more on this growing multiple investigations
set now on The David Pakman Show Instagram.

